data: {"Content":{"parts":[{"text":"## Run report — partial\n\nHere's the current weather in **Boston, MA**:\n\n---\n\n🌧️ **Right Now** *(as of ~3:17 AM UTC)*\n- **Moderate rain**\n- **63°F / 17°C** — feels like 61°F\n- Humidity: 98% | Visibility: 4 miles\n- Wind: 10 mph from the SSW\n- Sunrise: 6:24 AM | Sunset: 4:31 PM\n\n---\n\n📅 **3-Day Forecast**\n\n| Day | Conditions | High | Low |\n|-----|-----------|------|-----|\n| **Today (Nov 6)** | 🌧 Rain throughout the day | 66°F / 19°C | 62°F / 17°C |\n| **Tomorrow (Nov 7)** | 🌫 Fog in the morning, then overcast, clearing by evening | 62°F / 17°C | 51°F / 11°C |\n| **Sun (Nov 8)** | 🌧→☀️ Morning drizzle, turning sunny in the afternoon | 57°F / 14°C | 48°F / 9°C |\n\n---\n\nA rainy Friday for Boston, but the weekend brings some relief — Sunday afternoon should see sunshine and clearing skies! Grab an umbrella if you're heading out today.\n\n### Unverified\n- Tool http_request returned without independently verified outcome metadata.\n\nRun: 0d3fce05-2910-4ed0-a81e-35dddec5391d\n"}],"role":"model"},"CitationMetadata":null,"GroundingMetadata":null,"UsageMetadata":null,"CustomMetadata":null,"LogprobsResult":null,"InputTranscription":null,"OutputTranscription":null,"ModelVersion":"","Partial":false,"TurnComplete":false,"Interrupted":false,"SessionResumptionHandle":"","ErrorCode":"","ErrorMessage":"","FinishReason":"","AvgLogprobs":0,"ID":"2180bc8c-126c-5d93-a59d-4ea043d24b7f","Timestamp":"2026-11-07T03:17:24.923905Z","InvocationID":"bot-report:0d3fce05-2910-4ed0-a81e-35dddec5391d","Branch":"","Author":"assistant","Actions":{"StateDelta":null,"ArtifactDelta":null,"RequestedToolConfirmations":null,"SkipSummarization":false,"TransferToAgent":"","Escalate":false},"LongRunningToolIDs":null}

